@@ -217,6 +217,10 @@ Example usage::
     import click
     click.edit(filename='/etc/passwd')
 
+Use ``process_priority`` to request one of five ordered CPU scheduling levels
+for the editor. Unsupported levels or insufficient permissions fall back to
+the platform default; leaving it as ``None`` preserves process creation.
+
 
